# Cloudflare Pages redirect map.
#
# This file is copied verbatim into the static export, so it is the only place a
# 301 can live on this site — Next.js `redirects()` does not run under
# `output: 'export'`. Anything that changes a live URL needs an entry here.
#
# Format: <from> <to> <status>
# Rules are matched top to bottom. Keep the list ordered oldest-first so newer
# rules cannot be shadowed by a broader older one.

